WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:12.108
It was Hada's turn to get weighed.

2
00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:14.718
We never leave him out.

3
00:00:14.719 --> 00:00:20.004
He seems to have grown so much.

4
00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:22.988
Bada: Mom, what about Hada?

5
00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.347
Mom: Yes. I need to know his weight.

6
00:00:26.348 --> 00:00:30.782
Bada: I'll get him.

7
00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:34.249
Oh, he is heavy, Mom.

8
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.126
Mom: Put him on the scale.

9
00:00:36.127 --> 00:00:39.920
Oh, no. He needs to be still.

10
00:00:39.921 --> 00:00:41.596
Mom: I know what.

11
00:00:41.597 --> 00:00:48.314
Let me hold him and we'll get weighed together.

12
00:00:48.315 --> 00:00:51.193
Hana: Then you can get weighed alone.

13
00:00:51.194 --> 00:00:54.488
Mom: That's right. Let's see.

14
00:00:54.489 --> 00:00:58.339
Come here, Hada.

15
00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:02.342
Mom: We weigh 61.5 kilograms.

16
00:01:02.343 --> 00:01:06.977
Now Hada can sit down.

17
00:01:06.978 --> 00:01:09.187
Mom: I will check my weight.

18
00:01:09.188 --> 00:01:12.774
Mom: I weigh 52 kilograms.

19
00:01:12.775 --> 00:01:18.209
So how much does Hada weigh?

20
00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:22.596
Hana: Hada weighs 9.5 kilograms.

21
00:01:22.597 --> 00:01:27.088
Mom: That is correct.

22
00:01:27.089 --> 00:01:29.720
Hada weighs quite a lot.

23
00:01:29.721 --> 00:01:34.816
He grows so fast.
